        },
        {
          "left": "64.0px",
          "top": "390.0px",
          "width": "666.0px",
          "height": "405.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:Georgia, serif; font-size:13.5px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.75;'><p style='margin-top:0; margin-bottom:16px;'>Dear Members of the Executive Committee,</p><p style='margin-bottom:16px;'>Following our comprehensive review last week, we are pleased to present the finalized strategic framework and project milestones outlined for the upcoming quarter. Our team has thoroughly audited all operational, financial, and compliance requirements to ensure seamless execution from day one.</p><p style='margin-bottom:16px;'>Key highlights of our deliverable package include:</p><ul style='margin-bottom:16px; padding-left:22px; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.65; color:#334155;'><li><strong>Phase I Implementation:</strong> Full architectural alignment, baseline verification, and stakeholder onboarding completed ahead of schedule.</li><li><strong>Quality & Risk Assurance:</strong> Multi-tier verification protocols established to safeguard timeline integrity and budget predictability.</li><li><strong>Dedicated Account Leadership:</strong> Weekly executive briefings and real-time milestone reporting accessible via your client portal.</li></ul><p style='margin-bottom:0;'>Please review the enclosed documentation at your convenience. Should you require any adjustments prior to formal sign-off, our senior leadership team remains at your immediate disposal.</p></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 5,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
        {
          "left": "64.0px",
